        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_075addc7800a4585b630f60225661532",
      "statement": "Pipeline creation builds a task list with Airbyte syncs first (by seq) then transform tasks; when dbt tasks exist it auto-prepends git-clone (EKS workpool) or git-pull plus dbt-clean and dbt-deps, ignores git/clean/deps tasks sent by the frontend, stores the tasks in deployment parameters config {tasks, org_slug, continue_on_sync_failure}, and mirrors them into OrgDataFlowv1 and DataflowOrgTask.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/ddpui/core/orchestrate/pipeline_service.py#L80-L273",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5547d63764a1f89415316d82846db685c0f83a056ea59e48210b57edc79b06e4:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_591112495b4f444496fe6e46166de81d",
      "statement": "Running a pipeline atomically creates one TaskLock per mapped OrgTask (rejecting with 400 if any is already locked), asks the proxy to create a flow run, records a PrefectFlowRun in Scheduled state, releases the locks if the proxy call fails, and otherwise stamps the flow-run id on the locks.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/ddpui/core/orchestrate/pipeline_service.py#L520-L576",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4ec8b4490a62ee667745dfe5573a8bcc560fb66491905013d57bfffc780e25f7:"
