      "id": "claim_04d537ca3fa745dcbc043e8375c4b39c",
      "statement": "Manual (Transform-tab) dbt deployments are created only for LONG_RUNNING_TASKS, chain git pull/clone, dbt-clean, dbt-deps and the primary dbt task, and are stored as OrgDataFlowv1 with dataflow_type 'manual', whereas user-built pipelines use 'orchestrate'.",
