      "statement": "The Secret block dbt-profile-<org.slug> is written by create_or_update_dbt_profile_secret_blk as JSON {wtype, default_schema, creds, extras}; OrgWarehouse.dbt_profile_secret_block is the authoritative FK, with a mirrored OrgDbt FK kept for compatibility.",
