    {
      "id": "claim_db60763b628941ce808cc1f1c9464f84",
      "statement": "dbtjob_v2_runner loads the dbt-profile Secret block, builds a single-output profiles.yml (target 'default', 4 threads, postgres or bigquery), writes it plus any Postgres root cert, then runs the worker's own dbt binary through ShellOperation with --profiles-dir and --project-dir; a failing dbt-test yields a COMPLETED state named DBT_TEST_FAILED instead of failing the run.",
