    {
      "id": "claim_c9c17888c79e441eb4d753cddd15ce14",
      "statement": "handle_prefect_webhook polls the flow run via the proxy and, for deployment runs, upserts PrefectFlowRun; terminal states delete TaskLocks for the flow run, Pending states lock the deployment's tasks as the system user and attach the flow-run id, and Failed/Crashed runs are retried (AwaitingRetry after 5 minutes, at most once) only when PREFECT_RETRY_CRASHED_FLOW_RUNS is enabled, which also suppresses the failure notification.",
