      "id": "claim_365276263a574db8889534ddf8d19800",
      "statement": "On Failed/Crashed (non-retried) runs the handler emails org managers with a message depending on dataflow type (orchestrate generic, manual listing connections or task slugs, generate-edr skipped) and notifies platform admins when NOTIFY_PLATFORM_ADMINS_OF_ERRORS is set; a finally block always refreshes the last 6 hours of Airbyte job history for Airbyte tasks in the run and enqueues log summarization for failed or crashed runs, while body errors are caught and logged rather than raised.",
